c=ev('https://www.nitto.com/au/en/products/semicon/dicing002/index.jsp','Regional manufacturer table identifies EM-700 and EM-310/400 series. US EM-500 separately listed; regional availability differs.')
d=ev('https://www.nitto.com/au/en/products/semicon/moldingsemicon002/index.jsp','Manufacturer specifies PW-3610A and TRM-6250L heat-resistant masking/protection materials with semiconductor packaging applications.')
e=ev('https://www.nitto.com/au/en/products/semicon/sintering001/index.jsp','Manufacturer describes FS-A101 silver-particle sintering film for semiconductor bonding.')
f=ev('https://www.nitto.com/au/en/products/semicon/equipmentdicing005/index.jsp','Manufacturer identifies MR3000III remounter combining MA3000III and frame removal unit; not two invented standalone systems.')
g=ev('https://www.nitto.com/us/en/press/2023/0915.jsp','ND-L02-s0201 Phase 2 IPF expected efficacy absent; BMS declined pulmonary option and stopped NASH trial. Other liver fibrosis development mentioned, so not globally discontinued by that release.')
